---
title: Bridge batch · request path
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Owner
  participant L as Provider lease
  participant E as Engine
  participant G as Guest
  participant C as Children
  O->>L: acquire (reserve)
  O->>E: one snapshot
  O->>L: one registry save, release
  O->>L: acquire (start batch)
  O->>E: fence: targets only
  O->>G: start ticks, all pids
  O->>E: fence again
  O->>L: save every intent
  O->>G: start every relay
  O->>E: fence again
  O->>L: save running, release
  O->>C: spawn every child
  Note over C,L: each child, in turn
  C->>L: wait, acquire
  C->>E: fence: its target
  C->>G: relay inspect
  C->>C: journal, exec publisher
  C->>L: release
  O->>C: await all published
